# AYRA – Personal AI Assistant

AYRA is a personal AI copilot that helps you automate tasks on your PC,
reply to WhatsApp messages, summarize notes, and more – all through voice or chat.


## Features
- Voice commands for opening apps, search, media
- WhatsApp read & reply automation
- AI-powered help for study, coding, and writing

